{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0246-s001", "text": "Finland har högertrafik.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0246-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.716734693877551, "peak": 0.3035888671875, "generation_seconds": 12.589501600014046, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:10:42.533188+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0247-s001", "text": "I Finland är det vanligt att människor förflyttar sig korta sträckor till fots.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0247-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.29144287109375, "generation_seconds": 30.877349348040298, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:11:16.142086+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0247-s002", "text": "Städerna är planerade så att det är tryggt att gå.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0247-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.330291748046875, "generation_seconds": 21.665731973014772, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:11:49.679179+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0247-s003", "text": "Det finns övergångsställen med jämna mellanrum för fotgängare som ska korsa gatan, och ofta finns det också trafikljus.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0247-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.31658935546875, "generation_seconds": 41.33424240001477, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:12:23.266486+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0247-s004", "text": "På landsbygden finns det inte så ofta trottoarer längs vägarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0247-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.369598388671875, "generation_seconds": 18.994096936890855, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0247-s005", "text": "Då ska fotgängare gå längs den vänstra kanten av körbanan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0247-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.251678466796875, "generation_seconds": 15.14511134987697, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:12:53.267819+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0248-s001", "text": "Ett annat bra sätt att förflytta sig är med cykel.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0248-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.379364013671875, "generation_seconds": 13.209565468132496, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0248-s002", "text": "I Finland cyklar en del till jobbet eller skolan också på vintern.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0248-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.296356201171875, "generation_seconds": 16.328733515925705, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:13:26.969082+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0248-s003", "text": "Endast små barn får cykla på trottoaren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0248-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.316741943359375, "generation_seconds": 11.213702311972156, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0248-s004", "text": "Övriga cyklar på en separat cykelbana eller ett separat cykelfält.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0248-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.344879150390625, "generation_seconds": 15.391345442039892, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:14:00.438683+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0248-s005", "text": "Om sådana saknas cyklar man på körbanan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0248-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.1099319727891155, "peak": 0.291412353515625, "generation_seconds": 10.367951215943322, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0248-s006", "text": "När man cyklar ska man använda cykelhjälm, och när det är mörkt ska cykeln ha en lykta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0248-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.29876708984375, "generation_seconds": 15.493517610011622, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:14:34.021325+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0249-s001", "text": "De största städerna i Finland har bra kollektivtrafik.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0249-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.2757568359375, "generation_seconds": 13.741138360928744, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0249-s002", "text": "Med kollektivtrafik avses bussar, lokaltåg, metro och spårvagn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0249-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.31201171875, "generation_seconds": 11.172294859075919, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:15:07.609920+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0249-s003", "text": "Man kan köpa engångsbiljetter, seriebiljetter eller månadsbiljetter till kollektivtrafiken och använda den för att ta sig till jobbet eller skolan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0249-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.538775510204081, "peak": 0.506378173828125, "generation_seconds": 24.093739536125213, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0249-s004", "text": "I små städer och på landsbygden finns det färre kollektivtrafiklinjer och de trafikeras mer sällan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0249-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.32269287109375, "generation_seconds": 19.457275431137532, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:15:41.197357+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0250-s001", "text": "I Finland kan man ta sig till de flesta ställen med buss, tåg, flyg eller båt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0250-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.28594970703125, "generation_seconds": 17.475103111937642, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0250-s002", "text": "En del av trafiken går endast sällan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0250-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.29351806640625, "generation_seconds": 11.049750105012208, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:16:14.847782+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0251-s001", "text": "Egen bil, bensin, försäkringsavgifter, skatter och bilservice är dyra i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0251-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.291839599609375, "generation_seconds": 19.075666681863368, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:16:48.366619+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0251-s002", "text": "I de större städerna behöver man vanligtvis ingen egen bil.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0251-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.24200439453125, "generation_seconds": 16.225715009029955, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0251-s003", "text": "På mindre orter kan en egen bil ändå vara nödvändig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0251-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.23486328125, "generation_seconds": 16.58980576088652, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:17:21.953381+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0252-s001", "text": "När man kör med bil i trafiken måste man noggrant följa de trafikregler som gäller i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0252-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.263031005859375, "generation_seconds": 28.491457474883646, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:17:55.671383+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0252-s002", "text": "Polisen övervakar bilisterna och ger böter om de bryter mot reglerna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0252-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.321563720703125, "generation_seconds": 18.758074439130723, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0252-s003", "text": "Man får inte köra bil om man har druckit alkohol.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0252-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.3118896484375, "generation_seconds": 13.977400120114908, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:18:29.159780+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0252-s004", "text": "Gränsvärdet för att få köra är 0,5 promille.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0252-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.313201904296875, "generation_seconds": 14.697540754918009, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0253-s001", "text": "Om du har en bil måste du teckna en trafikförsäkring (liikennevakuutus).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0253-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.271331787109375, "generation_seconds": 16.184064178960398, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:19:02.763015+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0253-s002", "text": "Trafikförsäkringen tecknar du hos ett försäkringsbolag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0253-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.361053466796875, "generation_seconds": 13.989034997066483, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0254-s001", "text": "I Finland måste bilen besiktigas och registreras.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0254-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.244110107421875, "generation_seconds": 14.425186487147585, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0254-s002", "text": "Besiktningar görs på besiktningsstationer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0254-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.287567138671875, "generation_seconds": 11.788608491187915, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:19:36.322674+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0254-s003", "text": "Registreringen kan göras till exempel på besiktningsstationer, vid försäkringsbolag och hos bilhandlare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0254-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.299652099609375, "generation_seconds": 22.91937982197851, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:20:09.918529+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0254-s004", "text": "Du kan även registrera bilen på Traficoms webbplats.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0254-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.34759521484375, "generation_seconds": 15.607647649012506, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0255-s001", "text": "Du kan köra i Finland endast om du har ett giltigt körkort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0255-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.26556396484375, "generation_seconds": 18.631220654817298, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:20:39.920087+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0256-s001", "text": "I Finland accepteras alla körkort som är beviljade i stater som Finland har erkänt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0256-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.327728271484375, "generation_seconds": 24.048553346889094, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:21:13.578003+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0256-s002", "text": "Ett utländskt körkort accepteras inte om kortinnehavaren har bott i Finland vid den tidpunkt som kortet beviljades.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0256-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.752380952380953, "peak": 0.2559814453125, "generation_seconds": 31.986533398972824, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:21:47.142115+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
2026-11-03T08:22:20.683976+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0257-s001", "text": "Texten på körkortet ska vara skriven med latinska bokstäver eller så ska du ha med dig en översättning av körkortet till finska, svenska eller engelska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0257-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.956734693877552, "peak": 0.33416748046875, "generation_seconds": 42.39488762198016, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0257-s002", "text": "Du måste också uppfylla de ålders- och hälsokrav för körkort som gäller i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0257-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.290679931640625, "generation_seconds": 22.681505762040615, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:22:54.271532+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
2026-11-03T08:23:27.959165+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0258-s001", "text": "Om du har ett körkort som beviljats i ett E U- eller E E S-land, kan du köra med detta kort i Finland så länge kortet är giltigt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0258-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.911836734693878, "peak": 0.300140380859375, "generation_seconds": 36.723327913088724, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:24:01.436552+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0258-s002", "text": "Du kan du byta ut kortet mot ett finländskt körkort om du bor stadigvarande i Finland eller har studerat i Finland i minst sex månader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0258-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.42421768707483, "peak": 0.374053955078125, "generation_seconds": 36.82129554194398, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:24:35.022165+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0258-s003", "text": "Ett körkort som ger rätt att framföra personbil måste bytas mot ett finskt körkort inom två år från att dess giltighetstid har gått ut.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0258-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.727619047619047, "peak": 0.32354736328125, "generation_seconds": 35.4304383629933, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:25:08.620918+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0258-s004", "text": "Om kortets giltighetstid gått ut behöver du ett läkarutlåtande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0258-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.296844482421875, "generation_seconds": 18.61631264584139, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:25:42.205593+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0259-s001", "text": "Om du har ett körkort som utfärdats i ett land utanför E U som är anslutet till Genève- eller Wienkonventionerna om vägtrafik, kan du köra med detta kort högst två år i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0259-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.464489795918368, "peak": 0.35223388671875, "generation_seconds": 45.82826355099678, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:26:15.788576+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0259-s002", "text": "Med ett körkort som utfärdats i Hongkong, Macao eller Taiwan får du likaså köra bil i högst två år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0259-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.32171630859375, "generation_seconds": 21.714468762045726, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:26:49.375929+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0259-s003", "text": "Du kan byta ditt utländska körkort mot ett finskt körkort när du bor stadigvarande i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0259-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.279205322265625, "generation_seconds": 23.03110528108664, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:27:22.961308+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0259-s004", "text": "När du har flyttat till Finland och bor här stadigvarande har du två år på dig att byta ditt körkort mot ett finskt körkort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0259-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.285614013671875, "generation_seconds": 31.55131383310072, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0259-s005", "text": "Ditt körkort måste vara giltigt vid den tidpunkt när du byter det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0259-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.29559326171875, "generation_seconds": 19.097573642851785, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:27:56.546411+00:00 hb-c11-trafik tts: PID 262144 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0259-s006", "text": "Du behöver också ett läkarutlåtande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-trafik/narration/hb-c11-u0259-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.34149169921875, "generation_seconds": 10.351703827967867, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
